{
  "before": [
    [
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "The storm has moved the harbour indoors. Every stretcher smells of salt.",
        "expr": "alarmed",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Where is Doctor Vale?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Elbow-deep in a bus driver. This one is yours, Doctor.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Anton Deverell. Fifty-six. Fishing hooks and cable fragments in the forearm.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "He repairs the nets that bring this city its breakfast.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "He asked whether he would lose his hand.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "What did you tell him?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "That I would do everything I could.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Then let us make that a considerable amount.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "His pressure is holding. Mine is doing something less professional.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Teddy",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "My father tuned pianos. He said shaking hands could still find the right note.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Your father was right. Forceps, Doctor.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Doctor Quill. I have cleared my schedule to observe a routine appendectomy.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "I did not know routine cases required an audience.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "They require an absence of excuses. An audience helps.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Rosalind Pike. Harbour pilot. Acute appendicitis.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "A pilot knows that a channel is never the same river twice.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Neither is an abdomen.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Good. You have read something besides your chart.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "She says the ferry is double-parked. Is that a medical emergency?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Teddy",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Everything outside these doors can wait.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Bashir",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "She brings people home through the fog.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Then bring her home through this.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Scalpel.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "The grain terminal. The whole east wall. There are people in the corridor I cannot count.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Teddy",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Then count one. The one on this table.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Teddy",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "Ivo Senn. Foreman. He went back for the youngest loader.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Teddy",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "And brought him out. That loader is in recovery.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Bashir",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Tell him when he wakes.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Teddy",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "The shrapnel is close to the pulmonary artery. I can see the pressure falling.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Teddy",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "I can hear something else falling.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Teddy",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Doctor?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Bashir",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Nothing. The monitor is sharp. Half a note sharp.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Teddy",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "It is a monitor, Mara. They do not have notes.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Teddy",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Tonight everything has a note.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Teddy",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Then keep this one sounding.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Bashir",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "corridor"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Vane",
        "text": "Doctor Quill. Your chief says you have a remarkable ear.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Vane",
        "set": "gala"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "She usually says I have a remarkable capacity to disappoint her.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Vane",
        "set": "gala"
      },
      {
        "who": "Vane",
        "text": "Ottoline mistakes affection for an administrative defect.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Vane",
        "set": "gala"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "The new wing is beautiful, Ms Vane.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Vane",
        "set": "gala"
      },
      {
        "who": "Vane",
        "text": "Beauty is a promise. I prefer to fund promises that can be kept.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Vane",
        "set": "gala"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Doctor. Theatre three is ready. The courier with the liver mass.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Bashir",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "gala"
      },
      {
        "who": "Vane",
        "text": "Elian Firth. He delivered our invitations in that dreadful rain.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Vane",
        "set": "gala"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "You remember his name.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Vane",
        "set": "gala"
      },
      {
        "who": "Vane",
        "text": "A city is only the people who carry it. Please take good care of him.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Vane",
        "set": "gala"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "I intend to.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Vane",
        "set": "gala"
      },
      {
        "who": "Vane",
        "text": "I know. That is why I wanted to meet you.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Vane",
        "set": "gala"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Come, Doctor. The music upstairs can manage without us.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Bashir",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "gala"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "This lift has no button for the floor we are going to.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Then how do you call it?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "With a debt. Mine is eleven years old.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Welcome to the Night Ward, Doctor.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Bashir",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "There are beds down here. People. How many?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Enough to require your hands and too many to permit your fear.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "What was inside Elian?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Recombinant Enzymatic Quiescent Immuno-Evasive Microfilaria. R.E.Q.U.I.E.M.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "That is a name someone chose.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Yes. The only organism engineered to keep time.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "For what?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Rosalind Pike is back. Ask her lungs.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "If you have come for an apology, the machine dispenses tea. It is equally bitter.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "depot"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "There is a resident at Mercy Harbor. She hears the rhythm.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "depot"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "Then buy her a piano.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "depot"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "She saved five people and collapsed before she could remove her gloves.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "depot"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "You always did know how to spend someone else.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "depot"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Solomon Eke is on the table. Shattered femur. Something growing in the marrow.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "depot"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "I signed my retirement papers, Ottoline. You witnessed them.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "depot"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "And I have kept a clean pair of scrubs in your locker for nine years.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "depot"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "My right hand shakes.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "depot"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Your left still terrifies everyone who has ever assisted you.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "depot"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "I have buried better surgeons than that resident, and liked them less.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "depot"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Is that a yes, Perpetua?",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "depot"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "You have not stopped touching your sternum since I arrived.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "A tiresome habit. Put it in my annual review.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "How long?",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Eleven years. I thought if I carried the first sample, I could keep it contained.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "You helped build it.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "We were going to put damaged hearts to sleep until we could mend them.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "And someone taught the sleep to spread.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Someone paid. I let myself believe payment was the same thing as purpose.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "You will name them when you wake.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "If I die on your table, Perpetua, you will have to fill out the form.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "I have been looking forward to it.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Chief Voss has no pulse. Theatre one. Now.",
        "expr": "alarmed",
        "left": "Bashir",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "scrub"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "Bashir opened the flowers. One breath. That was all.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Teddy",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Where is he?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "On your table. His heart is conducting all four movements.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "He told me to count one patient. Just one.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "There is no scrub nurse. I can manage the monitor. I can try the instruments.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Teddy",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Scalpel.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "Right. Yes. The sharp one with the quiet handle.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Teddy",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "Look at me, Mara. We cannot outplay it alone.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "My hands have stopped shaking.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "That is because they know whose life they are holding.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Bashir. If you can hear me, keep counting.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "We will play the space between.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "ward"
      }
    ]
  ],
  "after": [
    [
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Your hands were steady.",
        "expr": "soft",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "They were not. I was counting his heartbeats.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "That is one way to make them steady.",
        "expr": "soft",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Will he mend nets again?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "He will complain about the stitches for a month. That is usually a good sign.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "He asked for his hooks back. I have recommended a different hobby.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Teddy",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "One patient.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "And the night is young, Doctor.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Adequate.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "The artery ruptured. I controlled the bleed in twelve seconds.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "I was watching, Doctor Quill.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "She will live.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "In my hospital, adequate is a kind of malpractice. Tonight I mean it as praise.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Chief. The harbour sirens.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Bashir",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "The grain terminal. Clear every theatre.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "I am already scrubbed.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "gallery"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "You said now before the monitor changed.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "I was lucky.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Luck does not usually arrive precisely half a beat early.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Are you going to ask me how?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "No.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "expr": "soft",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "But if you hear it again, Doctor, I would appreciate the warning.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "So would I.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "corridor"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "You will wash your hands.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "What was that thing?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "You will sign nothing. You will tell no one what you did not see in this room.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "The ECG was a waltz. There must be a form for that.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Teddy",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "There is a lift below the morgue. Bashir has a key.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "And if I refuse?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Then tomorrow you will hear that rhythm in another patient and have no name for it.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Give me the key.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "She is breathing. Listen. There is no harmony underneath it.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Doctor Quill, your fingers.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Bashir",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "They will not open.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "Exhaustion. Or something exhaustion has never met before.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Teddy",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "There are still patients. I can hear them through the walls.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "You have done enough for one pair of hands.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "I have not done enough for one city.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Then we need a second opinion.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "ward"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Doctor Nwosu. For a moment there were two of you.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Bashir",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "There were always two of me, young man. One of them retired.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "You were magnificent.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "Do not become sentimental. It makes your face look unfamiliar.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Perpetua, there is something I should have told you before you came back.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "Ottoline?",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "Her knees. Catch her!",
        "expr": "alarmed",
        "left": "Teddy",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "scrub"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "No more secrets. Put her on the table.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "scrub"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "The Foundation. Cordelia Vane paid for the lab.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "You knew she was turning a treatment into a weapon.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "I knew too late. Then I made a career of believing late was the same as never.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "You are alive. Start there.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "Someone has sent flowers to the operating staff.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Teddy",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Voss",
        "text": "Who signed the card?",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "The Vane Foundation. Bashir has them.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Teddy",
        "right": "Pet",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "Do not let him touch them.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Voss",
        "set": "recovery"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "You are in recovery. The surgery is over.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "How was the field?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Terrible. Your substitute scrub nurse nearly passed out.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Teddy",
        "text": "An exaggerated account. I sat down with unusual commitment.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Teddy",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Pet",
        "text": "The night is over, Bashir.",
        "expr": "stern",
        "left": "Pet",
        "right": "Mara",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "And your hands, Doctor?",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Mara",
        "text": "Still counting.",
        "expr": "neutral",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      },
      {
        "who": "Bashir",
        "text": "Clean, Doctor.",
        "expr": "soft",
        "left": "Mara",
        "right": "Bashir",
        "set": "recovery"
      }
    ]
  ],
  "epilogue": [
    {
      "who": "Vane",
      "text": "Yes. I am already beyond the harbour lights.",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "left": "Vane",
      "right": "",
      "set": "ship"
    },
    {
      "who": "Vane",
      "text": "No, leave the hospital alone. They have earned a little sleep.",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "left": "Vane",
      "right": "",
      "set": "ship"
    },
    {
      "who": "Vane",
      "text": "A promising first movement.",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "left": "Vane",
      "right": "",
      "set": "ship"
    },
    {
      "who": "Vane",
      "text": "Have them tune the orchestra.",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "left": "Vane",
      "right": "",
      "set": "ship"
    }
  ]
}
